        "path_or_url": "wiki/Configuration.md",
        "section": "Configuration > Configuration Reference > Vector store",
        "snippet": "A fresh configuration uses `retrieval.default_mode: lexical` for queries. Ingest can auto-start managed Qdrant and embed chunks with FastEmbed; the `vector_store:` block tunes that optional vector store. Select `dense`, `sparse`, or `hybrid` explicitly when vector retrieval is required. Those modes fail closed when required capabilities are unavailable unless the caller explicitly enables degraded fallback. Set `DOCATLAS_AUTO_VECTORS=0` (or run `doc-atlas ingest --no-vectors`) for FTS5-only ingestion.",
